SAFETY NOTICE

This software drives laser projection hardware. Laser light can cause
permanent eye injury and can start fires. Nothing above should be read as a
claim that this software is safe for any particular installation — the "AS IS"
and limitation-of-liability terms apply to the beam as much as to the code.
You are responsible for your own rig and for the laser-display rules that
apply where you are.

